    <!-- Konami VRC6 cartridge (mapper 24). The game's sound driver is called as the game's own NMI does: the update
         routine ($E238) once a frame and, to start a sound, the request routine ($E249) with the sound number in A.
         $E151 and $E211 are the driver's start-up routines. The routines run with the 16 KB bank 0x0C at $8000 (the
         driver switches $8000 to the bank holding a song's data by itself) and the 8 KB bank 0x07 at $C000 (the
         DMC samples; bank 0x1E has the same data up to $C8FF but other data after it, and the voices at $C900 and
         $D400 are in bank 0x07). Numbers 0x01-0x4F are sound effects, 0x50-0x6E songs and 0x6F-0x7D effects played by the DMC;
         0x00 and 0x7E and above are not sounds, and 0x22, 0x35, 0x3A and 0x3B do nothing on their own. -->
